.DS_Store

# go.work and go.work.sum are tracked, not ignored. The usual advice to keep a
# workspace local applies to a workspace that papers over module boundaries
# during development; this one is the build definition for the modules that
# release, and CI verifies it is current (`make work-check`).
#
# `make work-full` rewrites go.work to add the modules that need
# gitlab-master.nvidia.com. That result is local-only -- undo it with
# `git checkout -- go.work` rather than committing it.
